. Then\n\\[\n1\\le u\\le\\sqrt{D/3},\\qquad (2v+u)^2=4D-3u^2.\n\\]\nChecking these short ranges gives:\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c}\nD&\\text{possible }u& (u,v)&k=111/D\\\\ \\hline\n3&1&(1,1)&37\\\\\n37&1,2,3&(3,4)&3\\\\\n111&1,2,3,4,5,6&(1,10)&1\n\\end{array}\n\\]\nIndeed, the only square values of \\(4D-3u^2\\) in these ranges are respectively \\(9,121,441\\). Restoring reversed progressions gives all solutions.\n\nIf natural numbers include \\(0\\), then \\((111,0,0)\\) is additionally a geometric progression with common ratio \\(0\\).\n\nFinal answer: \\(\\boxed{(37,37,37),\\ (27,36,48),\\ (48,36,27),\\ (1,10,100),\\ (100,10,1)}\\), with \\((111,0,0)\\) also included if \\(0\\) is allowed."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":132,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1159,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":731},"total_tokens":1291},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
